# Frontend currency

This rule is for Cardui only. It names this repo's formatters. Do not
copy it to another project as a general frontend rule.

When showing a money amount in the frontend, use `formatCurrency` from
`frontend/features/accounts/formatCurrency.ts`. Pass the currency code
for that amount.

Chart labels use `formatChartCurrency` and `formatChartAxisCurrency`
in `frontend/features/accounts/chartTimeRange.ts`. Those drop cents or
compact the axis. Do not add another `Intl.NumberFormat` currency
helper.

```tsx
formatCurrency(transaction.amount, transaction.isoCurrencyCode);
```
